		{
			description: [
				"The Ranker was an engineer and warrior who learned to capture enemy abilities and bind them to equipment. He forged a sword called Tears for Fears and developed the Ring of Ranker."
				""
				"A Warden's defeated call became the sword's shout. Each success drove him toward another experiment, supported by the craftsmen, researchers and travellers of the Brass Concord."
				""
				"They helped him, and he promised help in return. Twelve people were still waiting when he rushed to face the Hovering Inferno, hoping to capture its power before his preparations and greater awakening were complete."
				""
				"The Inferno killed him and kept his sword. His companions were left with damaged homes, scattered research and promises unfinished."
				""
				"Begin at Garrick Ashford's forge. Restore what he left waiting, hear the witnesses and retrace the craftsmanship, machinery and willing sacrifices behind the relics."
				""
				"These stories accompany your Create and GregTech progression. Your team's dimension encounters still govern travel. Recovering a relic and awakening its greater powers are separate milestones."
				""
				"The twelve restorations are personal. Each home you repair fulfils another part of The Unfinished Promise."
			]
